scheme.model_answer:
```javascript
attempts = 1;
while (attempts <= 3) {
    pin = prompt("Input your PIN-code:");
    if (pin == '1234') {
        alert("You entered successfully");
        break;
    }
    attempts++;
    alert("You have " + (4 - attempts) + " attempts");
}
if (attempts == 4)
    alert("Your attempts have ended");
```
